/a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-130-html-input-types-463" data-label="130. html input types">130. HTML Input Types</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-131-checkboxes-464" data-label="131. checkboxes">131. Checkboxes</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-132-radio-buttons-465" data-label="132. radio buttons">132. Radio Buttons</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-133-select-and-option-466" data-label="133. `&lt;select&gt;` and `&lt;option&gt;`">133. <code>&lt;select&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;option&gt;</code></a><a class="toc-level-2" href="#select-attributes-467" data-label="`&lt;select&gt;` attributes"><code>&lt;select&gt;</code> attributes</a><a class="toc-level-2" href="#option-attributes-468" data-label="`&lt;option&gt;` attributes"><code>&lt;option&gt;</code> attributes</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-134-textarea-469" data-label="134. `&lt;textarea&gt;`">134. <code>&lt;textarea&gt;</code></a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-135-form-action-470" data-label="135. form `action`">135. Form <code>action</code></a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-136-get-method-471" data-label="136. get method">136. GET Method</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-137-post-method-472" data-label="137. post method">137. POST Method</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-138-get-vs-post-473" data-label="138. get vs post">138. GET vs POST</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-139-php-superglobal-variables-474" data-label="139. php superglobal variables">139. PHP Superglobal Variables</a><a class="toc-level-2" href="#globals-475" data-label="`$_globals`"><code>$_GLOBALS</code></a><a class="toc-level-2" href="#server-476" data-label="`$_server`"><code>$_SERVER</code></a><a class="toc-level-2" href="#get-477" data-label="`$_get`"><code>$_GET</code></a><a class="toc-level-2" href="#post-478" data-label="`$_post`"><code>$_POST</code></a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-140-html-form-php-example-479" data-label="140. html form + php example">140. HTML Form + PHP Example</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-141-working-with-databases-480" data-label="141. working with databases">141. Working with Databases</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-142-storing-form-data-481" data-label="142. storing form data">142. Storing Form Data</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-143-database-connection-procedural-mysqli-482" data-label="143. database connection – procedural mysqli">143. Database Connection – Procedural MySQLi</a><a class="toc-level-2" href="#important-components-483" data-label="important components">Important components</a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#servername-484" data-label="`$servername`"><code>$servername</code></a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#username-485" data-label="`$username`"><code>$username</code></a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#password-486" data-label="`$password`"><code>$password</code></a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#dbname-487" data-label="`$dbname`"><code>$dbname</code></a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#mysqliconnect-488" data-label="`mysqli_connect()`"><code>mysqli_connect()</code></a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#conn-489" data-label="`$conn`"><code>$conn</code></a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#if-conn-490" data-label="`if (!$conn)`"><code>if (!$conn)</code></a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#die-491" data-label="`die()`"><code>die()</code></a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#mysqliconnecterror-492" data-label="`mysqli_connect_error()`"><code>mysqli_connect_error()</code></a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#mysqliclose-493" data-label="`mysqli_close()`"><code>mysqli_close()</code></a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-144-database-connection-oop-mysqli-494" data-label="144. database connection – oop mysqli">144. Database Connection – OOP MySQLi</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-145-procedural-vs-oop-database-connection-495" data-label="145. procedural vs oop database connection">145. Procedural vs OOP Database Connection</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-146-inserting-form-data-into-database-496" data-label="146. inserting form data into database">146. Inserting Form Data into Database</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-147-mysqlirealescapestring-497" data-label="147. `mysqli_real_escape_string()`">147. <code>mysqli_real_escape_string()</code></a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-148-retrieving-data-from-a-database-498" data-label="148. retrieving data from a database">148. Retrieving Data from a Database</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-149-procedural-data-retrieval-499" data-label="149. procedural data retrieval">149. Procedural Data Retrieval</a><a class="toc-level-2" href="#mysqliquery-conn-sql-500" data-label="`mysqli_query($conn, $sql)`"><code>mysqli_query($conn, $sql)</code></a><a class="toc-level-2" href="#mysqlinumrows-result-501" data-label="`mysqli_num_rows($result)`"><code>mysqli_num_rows($result)</code></a><a class="toc-level-2" href="#mysqlifetchassoc-result-502" data-label="`mysqli_fetch_assoc($result)`"><code>mysqli_fetch_assoc($result)</code></a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-150-oop-data-retrieval-503" data-label="150. oop data retrieval">150. OOP Data Retrieval</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-151-creating-a-database-table-with-php-504" data-label="151. creating a database table with php">151. Creating a Database Table with PHP</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-152-updating-table-data-505" data-label="152. updating table data">152. Updating Table Data</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-153-alter-table-506" data-label="153. alter table">153. ALTER TABLE</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-154-deleting-table-data-507" data-label="154. deleting table data">154. Deleting Table Data</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-155-retrieving-data-and-prefilling-forms-508" data-label="155. retrieving data and prefilling forms">155. Retrieving Data and Prefilling Forms</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-156-important-student-revision-map-509" data-label="156. important student revision map">156. Important Student Revision Map</a><a class="toc-level-2" href="#html-510" data-label="html">HTML</a><a class="toc-level-2" href="#css-511" data-label="css">CSS</a><a class="toc-level-2" href="#php-512" data-label="php">PHP</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-157-recommended-static-webpage-structure-for-the-vs-code-agent-513" data-label="157. recommended static webpage structure for the vs code agent">157. Recommended Static Webpage Structure for the VS Code Agent</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-158-recommended-student-friendly-presentation-514" data-label="158. recommended student-friendly presentation">158. Recommended Student-Friendly Presentation</a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#concept-515" data-label="concept">Concept</a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#why-it-is-used-516" data-label="why it is used">Why it is used</a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#syntax-517" data-label="syntax">Syntax</a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#example-518" data-label="example">Example</a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#what-happens-519" data-label="what happens?">What happens?</a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#remember-520" data-label="remember">Remember</a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#compare-521" data-label="compare">Compare</a><a class="toc-level-3" href="#quick-check-522" data-label="quick check">Quick Check</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-159-important-relationship-to-show-visually-523" data-label="159. important relationship to show visually">159. Important Relationship to Show Visually</a><a class="toc-level-1" href="#chapter-160-final-conceptual-summary-524" data-label="160. final conceptual summary">160. Final Conceptual Summary</a><a class="toc-level-2" href="#end-of-source-based-note-525" data-label="end of source-based note">End of Source-Based Note</a></nav>
